title They kicked it over their own goal line
intro Red has the ball near their goal.
flip vertical

setup
  lineup 7v7
  player R-RF at 88.2, 19.0
  ball with R-RF

step
  caption Red has the ball near their own goal.

step
  caption Red kicks it away — but it goes over their own goal line.
  ball to 110.3, 4.1
  arrow from R-RF to ball
  draw goal-line right
  duration 1450

question
  prompt Who gets the ball?
  answer Blue
  wrong Red
  wrong Nobody
  wrong Play on
  correct Blue's ball.
  why Red last touched it over their own goal line, so you get the ball.

question
  prompt What restart is it?
  answer Corner
  wrong Throw-in
  wrong Goal kick
  wrong Kick-off
  correct Corner kick.
  why If they last touch it over their own goal line, you get a corner kick.
